    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in either player's Fight phase, right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Pick 1 **NECRONS** unit of yours that is a target of at least one of those attacks.\n\nUntil the phase ends, whenever one of its models that is yet to fight this phase is **destroyed**, roll a D6, adding 1 if an unravelling unit made the attack, and on a 4+ leave the model in play: it may fight once the attacking unit finishes its attacks, then it is removed.",
